<title>PHILIPPINES: Far East cuts prime rate to 11.5-12.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Far East cuts prime rate to 11.5-12.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Far East Bank and Trust Co Inc said on Tuesday it had cut its prime lending rate to a range of 11.5 to 12.5 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;It was slightly lower than last week,&quot; a Far East official said, without giving the previous week's level.</p>
<p>She said the slight reduction was prompted by the marginal 8.0 basis point decline in the benchmark 91-day Treasury bill rate on Monday which set a new 18-month low at 9.724 percent.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 632 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
